<title>USA: Connecticut Natural Gas names president.</title>
<headline>Connecticut Natural Gas names president.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connecticut Natural Gas Corp said it has elected Arthur Marquardt as president and chief operating officer, effective December 1.</p>
<p>The company said chairman and chief executive Victor Frauenhofer will retain his current titles.</p>
<p>Marquardt has been senior vice president of the Gas Business Union of the Long Island Lighting Co since 1992.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
